OL,4,CViagogo may have broken law on hidden  
OL,5,Cfees, watchdog provisionally finds     
OL,6,GTicket-reselling site Viagogo may have 
OL,7,Gbroken the law on hidden fees, the     
OL,8,GUK's competition body has said in a    
OL,9,Gprovisional finding.                   
OL,11,FThe Competition and Markets Authority  
OL,12,F(CMA) said it found that Viagogo       
OL,13,Ffailed to show consumers the total     
OL,14,Fprice upfront when they were buying    
OL,15,Ftickets "and added fees later in the   
OL,16,Fprocess, a practice known as drip      
OL,17,Fpricing".                              
OL,19,FThe CMA added that this was an initial 
OL,20,Ffinding, and it should not be assumed  
OL,21,Fthat the company had actually broken   
OL,22,Fthe law.                               
